<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Moorim Paper cancels IPO plan - watchdog.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Moorim Paper cancels IPO plan - watchdog.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Moorim Paper Manufacturing Co Ltd has cancelled its initial public offering plan, the Securities Supervisory Board said on Monday.</p>
<p>A statement from the board said Moorim had dropped the plan due to &quot;internal reasons&quot; but did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Moorim filed an application in March to offer for public subscription 690,000 shares at 10,000 won per share.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
